  "description": {
    "text": "Team Plasma Battle Gift Set, released on 16 November 2012 for the winter holidays, let players battle as Team Plasma: one ready-built 30-card Team Plasma half deck with five holo cards, Team Plasma's Giratina and Darkrai as full-art premium holos and special holos of Cofagrigus, Bisharp and Ghetsis. It also held a Team Plasma pin badge, a deck case, sleeves, a playmat, a coin, damage counters and markers and a power-up guide.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: プラズマ団バトルギフトセット",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20121106100529/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/pbg.html"
      },
      {
